## Mode/Slice Decision

- scope_reason: Primary reason architecture_runtime_depth: the shared run view requires splitting the central gate-check evaluator (node-bound reads) into capture and a pure projection shared by CLI, MCP and the Claude mod, and the event model needs a cross-process channel from the AGDF MCP server to host surfaces with lifetime/SoT rules. Secondary external_contract_depth: hosts read run view and events through a new MCP surface. Rejected structured_slice because full_depth_impacts_absent fails. UX Intent Definition required before PRD (ui_ux_impact medium: new visible state types and notices in the companion).
